WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:12.067
A temporary inbox for text, links, and addresses.

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:19.142
Save a reminder with an optional title and a three-hour expiration.

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:27.191
Copy the exact original content with one tap.

00:00:27.191 --> 00:00:42.612
Read the full content and give it another hour.

00:00:42.612 --> 00:00:54.059
Choose a custom expiration with the native calendar.

00:00:54.059 --> 00:01:02.307
Delete an item, then restore it with Undo.

00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:05.526
Choose the default expiration in Settings.

00:01:05.526 --> 00:01:11.565
Access privacy information and the public support pages.

00:01:11.565 --> 00:01:13.765
Capture it. Use it. Forget it.
